# metrics.jsonl is deliberately NOT ignored. It carries the per-run token
# counts and API cost, one line per run. Ignoring it meant the file lived
# only in the Actions cache, which GitHub evicts after seven days idle, so
# the spend history could vanish untouched. The commit step adds it.
